---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
  <h1>About AlligatorPelican</h1>

  <section>
    <h2>Purpose</h2>
    <p>
      AlligatorPelican tracks the public cost of the Alligator Alcatraz detention facility
      in the Florida Everglades. Every number on this site cites a public source. Claims
      without sources are not published. Opinions are clearly labeled and visually separated
      from factual claims.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Editorial Standards</h2>
    <p>
      Each factual assertion carries at least one citation linking to a non-retracted source.
      Figures are updated within 48 hours of a credible correction. Retracted sources remain
      visible on <a href="/sources">/sources</a> with retraction metadata — transparency over
      deletion.
    </p>
    <p>
      Full editorial checklist and contribution guidelines:
      <a href="/methodology">/methodology</a> and
      <a
        href="https://github.com/alligatorpelican/AlligatorPelican/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank"
      >CONTRIBUTING.md on GitHub ↗</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>
      To report a factual error or request a correction, email
      <a href="mailto:corrections@alligatorpelican.com">corrections@alligatorpelican.com</a>.
      Factual errors are corrected within 48 hours of a credible complaint; a correction notice
      is posted on <a href="/changelog">/changelog</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
